  "description": "TUKFEM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C103 H145 N14 O44 Tb6 Zn2 1+,N1 O3 1-,30(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Tb51 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb52 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb53 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb54 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb55 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb56 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn51 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn52 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.757-5.049 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.17-171.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb6Zn2(CO3)5(OH)(H2L)4(H3L)2(H4L)]NO3·30MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
